ct\",\n   \"request_proposal_shard_applied\",\n   \"request_pending_readindex_applied_gc\"\n  ],\n  \"hypothesis\": \"The committed notification is emitted when the entry is committed and the applied notification when it is applied, while an expired proposal is removed by the shard's gc pass and yields only a timeout without a later commit notification.\",\n  \"discriminator\": \"The observed result codes on the committed and completed channels for the fresh and expired proposals.\",\n  \"disposition\": \"active\"\n }\n]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
